Sheet1.Text_English:
'Here perished' in the Shoah
the entire Bivas family
from Pristina,
the entire Bachar family
from Pristina,
the entire Baruch family
from Sarajevo,
the entire Mentovitz family
from Novi Pazar,
all from Yugoslavia.
May the Eternal avenge their blood. 'May their souls be bound in the bundle of life'

